  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "The Quaternion class provides a robust, object-oriented wrapper around the gl-matrix quaternion type for 3D rotation representation. It encapsulates core mathematical operations such as multiplication, normalization, and interpolation (LERP/SLERP). Architecturally, it functions as a core data model within the physics engine, supporting state persistence via JsonSerializable interfaces."
